# The tape does not come back: found once a level run. Up onto the sculpture's plinth at Patricia's
# Green twice (tour-hayes's approach, a teleport back between): one tapeFound, one Tape goal. The
# landing on the plinth takes 116 ticks of air (as before city phase 10; 109 to 112 in between, as the
# curbs round it moved by cm).
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 run level hayes
cmd 100 teleport -233.8 447.5 10.05 0
cmd 130 set skater.vel.y 6.5
hold ollie 168..198
hold left 312..352
cmd 600 teleport -233.8 447.5 10.05 0
cmd 630 set skater.vel.y 6.5
hold ollie 668..698
hold left 812..852
run 1000
expect event tapeFound count == 1
expect event tapeFound{level=hayes} within 288..292
expect event levelGoal{level=hayes,id=tape} count == 1
expect event land{airTicks=116} count == 2
expect no event bail
